cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or paper, please cite the project as below."
title: "Autonomous Ackermann Vehicle: ROS 2 Jazzy Planning, Control, and Kalman Localization Stack"
abstract: "Integrated ROS 2 Jazzy and Gazebo Harmonic autonomy stack for a 1/10-scale Ackermann vehicle, combining quintic lane-change and oval city path planning, feedforward PID speed control, Stanley lateral steering, 5-state linearized Kalman localization, and embedded ATmega328P and RP2040 microcontroller firmware."
